[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0010","text":"“我出发了”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0020","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0030","text":"──啊，是Twister\n虽然可能不会有人看……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0040","text":"好，手机就到这里！\n得交给Producer先生保管才行……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0050","text":"……啊，有人评论了！\n这个人……好像来会场了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0060","text":"……真的……有人在啊……\n得加油才行啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0070","text":"对、对不起\n这次真的交给您了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0080","text":"──那么……我出发了\nProducer先生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0090","text":"嗯。我在这里给你加油"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12800100_03_0100","text":"…………──\n──好的！"}]
